hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15526","Abbad ibn Abbad al-Muhallabi narrated to us, from Hisham ibn Ziyad, from Uthman ibn al-Arqam ibn Abi al-Arqam al-Makhzumi, from his father, and he was of the Companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever steps over the necks of the people on Friday and separates between two after the emergence of the imam is like one dragging his intestines in the Fire."
